<title>MALAYSIA: Metrod (Malaysia) 1996 net up 15.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Metrod (Malaysia) 1996 net up 15.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  13.89	vs	   12.01</p>
<p>    Shr	   (cents)     34.7	 vs	   44.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		   580.29	vs	  597.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    16.22	vs	   14.82</p>
<p>    Dividend    (cents)     10.0	 vs	   10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The company's full name is Metrod (Malaysia) Bhd. It is engaged in the manufacture of electrical conductivity grade copper wires, rods and strips.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
